en I found capture cards."], [29.58, 32.4, "They use a plant-derived lure that attracts mites"], [32.4, 33.86, "up from deep inside the foam."], [34.06, 35.08, "They crawl onto the card,"], [35.3, 36.3, "the adhesive holds them,"], [36.52, 37.42, "and you throw the card away."], [37.66, 39.38, "Four cards, four corners of your bed,"], [39.52, 41.02, "replace them every 90 days."], [41.34, 43.5, "No spraying your skin, no spraying the mattress."], [43.78, 44.7, "Just a simple step"], [44.7, 46.52, "to help manage the mites where you sleep."], [46.68, 48.3, "See capture cards at the link below."], [48.54, 50.1, "There's a 90-day money-back guarantee,"], [50.4, 52.06, "and you don't even need to return anything."]]}